>
> \(h\) Delivery to the Administrative Agent of a solvency certificate from the Chief Financial Officer of the Borrower, in form and substance reasonably satisfactory to the Administrative Agent, certifying the solvency of the Borrower and its subsidiaries on a consolidated basis after giving effect to the Transactions;
